    "A handful of exact-duplicate (ts, price) pairs exist in the raw table -- harmless for daily resampling, deduplicated by the loader.",
    "This file is a static point-in-time export for reproducibility. It is NOT re-fetched automatically and will not reflect data added after the extraction time above."
